                        <h3>In-House FDA Submission Operations</h3>
                        <p>Unlike consulting firms that separate regulatory strategy from publishing and submission execution, we provide both capabilities through one coordinated team. Our in-house FDA submissions group delivers strategic and operational support for ESG NextGen, FDA Direct/CDER Direct, eSubmitter, eDRLS, Structured Product Labeling, and other applicable FDA submission channels.</p>

                        <p>We have completed more than 1,000 FDA submissions in recent years, including critical and time-sensitive submissions to CDER and CBER. Our experience helps clients avoid preventable technical failures, manage acknowledgments and validation issues, and maintain submission continuity under demanding timelines.</p>

                        <p>As FDA modernizes its electronic intake systems—including the transition to the cloud-based ESG NextGen Unified Submission Portal—we help biotechnology companies navigate changing technical requirements without diverting internal scientific and regulatory resources from product development.</p>
